# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rotate bosonic modes {#rotate-bosonic-modes}"
msgstr "Putarkan mod boson {#rotate-bosonic-modes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") mixes bosonic modes with a unitary matrix $U$, as a network of beamsplitters and phase shifters does. It is called **passive** because it conserves the total boson number: it moves bosons between modes and never creates or destroys one. (Squeezing and displacement are the *active* operations, and a mode rotation cannot express them.) It maps the creation operators as\n"
msgstr "Sebuah [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") mencampurkan mod boson dengan matriks uniter $U$, seperti rangkaian pemecah alur dan penganjak fasa. Ia dipanggil **pasif** kerana ia memelihara jumlah bilangan boson: ia menggerakkan boson antara mod dan tidak pernah mencipta atau memusnahkannya. (Pemampatan dan sesaran ialah operasi *aktif*, dan putaran mod tidak dapat menyatakannya.) Ia memetakan pengendali penciptaan sebagai\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"b^\\dagger_i \\mapsto \\sum_j U_{ji} \\, b^\\dagger_j \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"b^\\dagger_i \\mapsto \\sum_j U_{ji} \\, b^\\dagger_j \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "which on the full Fock space is the many-body unitary\n"
msgstr "yang pada ruang Fock penuh ialah uniter banyak-jasad\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\exp\\left(\\sum_{ij} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j\\right) \\, .\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\exp\\left(\\sum_{ij} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j\\right) \\, .\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the gate behind a linear-optical interferometer: send Fock states in, rotate the modes, and read out how the bosons redistribute. Like every gate of a [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") (see [Work with bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), it carries no truncation and no encoding. Both enter at transpile time, and this guide shows why the truncation needs particular care for a rotation.\n"
msgstr "Ini ialah Gate di sebalik interferometer optik linear: hantar keadaan Fock masuk, putarkan mod, dan baca bagaimana boson diagihkan semula. Seperti setiap Gate [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") (lihat [Bekerja dengan litar boson](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), ia tidak membawa pemangkasan dan tiada pengekodan. Kedua-duanya masuk semasa masa transpile, dan panduan ini menunjukkan mengapa pemangkasan memerlukan perhatian khusus bagi sesuatu putaran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a rotation {#build-a-rotation}"
msgstr "Bina satu putaran {#build-a-rotation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The constructor takes the $M \\times M$ unitary matrix. The gate acts on $M$ modes. The class does not check that the matrix is unitary, so that is your responsibility.\n"
msgstr "Pembina menerima matriks uniter $M \\times M$. Gate bertindak pada $M$ mod. Kelas ini tidak menyemak sama ada matriks itu uniter, jadi itu tanggungjawab anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common rotations have dedicated constructors. [`ModeRotation.beamsplitter()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter\") takes a mixing angle $\\theta$ and an optional phase $\\phi$, and $\\theta = \\pi/4$ gives the balanced 50:50 beamsplitter. [`ModeRotation.phase_shift()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift\") takes one phase per mode.\n"
msgstr "Putaran biasa mempunyai pembina khusus. [`ModeRotation.beamsplitter()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter\") menerima sudut pencampuran $\\theta$ dan fasa pilihan $\\phi$, dan $\\theta = \\pi/4$ memberikan pemecah alur seimbang 50:50. [`ModeRotation.phase_shift()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift\") menerima satu fasa bagi setiap mod.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also start from the anti-Hermitian generator $K$ and let the gate exponentiate it, which gives the rotation $\\exp(K)$. The generator is recovered with [`generator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator\").\n"
msgstr "Anda juga boleh bermula daripada penjana anti-Hermitian $K$ dan biarkan Gate mengeksponenkannya, yang memberikan putaran $\\exp(K)$. Penjana itu diperoleh semula dengan [`generator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bridge to the operator algebra is [`to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\"), which returns the Hermitian generator $H = \\sum_{ij} \\mathrm{i} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j$ as a [`BosonOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-boson-operator#qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator \"qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator\"), so that the gate is $e^{-\\mathrm{i} H}$. For the 50:50 beamsplitter, that is a pair of hopping terms with opposite imaginary coefficients. The operator is Hermitian, which is what an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate needs, and it conserves the particle number.\n"
msgstr "Jambatan ke aljabar pengendali ialah [`to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\"), yang mengembalikan penjana Hermitian $H = \\sum_{ij} \\mathrm{i} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j$ sebagai [`BosonOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-boson-operator#qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator \"qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator\"), supaya Gate itu ialah $e^{-\\mathrm{i} H}$. Bagi pemecah alur 50:50, itu ialah sepasang sebutan lompatan dengan pekali khayal yang bertentangan. Pengendali itu Hermitian, iaitu yang diperlukan oleh Gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), dan ia memelihara bilangan zarah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each term reads `(is_creation, mode)` from left to right, so the second one is $\\mathrm{i} \\tfrac{\\pi}{4} \\, b^\\dagger_1 b_0$.\n"
msgstr "Setiap sebutan membaca `(is_creation, mode)` dari kiri ke kanan, jadi yang kedua ialah $\\mathrm{i} \\tfrac{\\pi}{4} \\, b^\\dagger_1 b_0$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Act on Fock states {#act-on-fock-states}"
msgstr "Bertindak pada keadaan Fock {#act-on-fock-states}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A rotation moves bosons between modes, so its effect is easiest to see on Fock states. The Hong-Ou-Mandel effect is the standard example. Send one boson into each input mode of a balanced beamsplitter. The two paths that leave the bosons in different output modes interfere destructively, so the state $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ disappears and the bosons always leave together, in $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ or $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$, each with probability one half.\n"
msgstr "Putaran menggerakkan boson antara mod, jadi kesannya paling mudah dilihat pada keadaan Fock. Kesan Hong-Ou-Mandel ialah contoh piawai. Hantar satu boson ke setiap mod input pemecah alur seimbang. Dua laluan yang meninggalkan boson dalam mod output berbeza berinterferens secara pemusnah, jadi keadaan $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ lenyap dan boson sentiasa keluar bersama, dalam $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ atau $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$, masing-masing dengan kebarangkalian satu perdua.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the circuit on bosonic modes and lower it with the preset pass manager. The [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") fixes the truncation and the encoding at this point. A cutoff of `max_occupation=2` keeps the levels 0, 1, and 2 of every mode.\n"
msgstr "Bina litar pada mod boson dan turunkannya dengan pengurus laluan pratetap. [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") menetapkan pemangkasan dan pengekodan pada ketika ini. Had `max_occupation=2` mengekalkan aras 0, 1, dan 2 bagi setiap mod.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pipeline returns an ordinary qubit circuit. Read the outcome probabilities from the final state, here with Qiskit’s [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector), which is exact at this size. Any simulator that returns amplitudes or counts works. A Fock state $\\lvert n_0, n_1 \\rangle$ is a single computational basis state, whose index is given by the bit patterns of [`LevelEncoding.level_to_bits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits\"); the second mode’s qubits follow the first mode’s.\n"
msgstr "Saluran paip mengembalikan litar qubit biasa. Baca kebarangkalian hasil daripada keadaan akhir, di sini dengan [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) Qiskit, yang tepat pada saiz ini. Mana-mana simulator yang mengembalikan amplitud atau kiraan boleh digunakan. Keadaan Fock $\\lvert n_0, n_1 \\rangle$ ialah satu keadaan asas pengiraan, yang indeksnya diberikan oleh corak bit [`LevelEncoding.level_to_bits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits\"); qubit mod kedua mengikuti qubit mod pertama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ outcome has probability zero, and the two bunched outcomes share the probability equally.\n"
msgstr "Hasil $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ mempunyai kebarangkalian sifar, dan dua hasil berkelompok berkongsi kebarangkalian secara sama rata.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the cutoff {#choose-the-cutoff}"
msgstr "Pilih had {#choose-the-cutoff}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The previous result needs `max_occupation=2`. Run the same circuit with a cutoff of 1. That is enough to hold the input state $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$, but not the state that the rotation produces from it, which has weight on $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ and $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$:\n"
msgstr "Keputusan sebelumnya memerlukan `max_occupation=2`. Jalankan litar yang sama dengan had 1. Itu cukup untuk memuatkan keadaan input $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$, tetapi tidak keadaan yang dihasilkan putaran daripadanya, yang mempunyai berat pada $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ dan $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit runs without any error, and the answer is wrong: the state stays at $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ with probability one. A rotation mixes occupation sectors *within* a mode. Two bosons can end up in the same output mode, so the exact state has weight on occupation 2 in a mode that started with one boson. With a cutoff of 1 that level does not exist, and the truncated generator cannot move the state there.\n"
msgstr "Litar berjalan tanpa sebarang ralat, dan jawapannya salah: keadaan kekal pada $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ dengan kebarangkalian satu. Putaran mencampurkan sektor penghunian *dalam* satu mod. Dua boson boleh berakhir dalam mod output yang sama, jadi keadaan tepat mempunyai berat pada penghunian 2 dalam mod yang bermula dengan satu boson. Dengan had 1, aras itu tidak wujud, dan penjana terpangkas tidak dapat menggerakkan keadaan ke sana.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A bound on the occupation of the initial state is therefore not enough. The cutoff must cover the total boson number that can reach **any single mode** of the rotation. For $N$ bosons in total, the safe choice is a cutoff of $N$.\n"
msgstr "Batas pada penghunian keadaan awal oleh itu tidak mencukupi. Had mesti meliputi jumlah bilangan boson yang boleh sampai ke **mana-mana satu mod** putaran. Bagi $N$ boson keseluruhannya, pilihan selamat ialah had $N$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The same reasoning applies to every mode separately, so a mix of different cutoffs per mode (see [Describe the truncation with a LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)) makes a rotation easy to map incorrectly. A mode that can receive bosons needs a cutoff that covers what it can receive, not only what it holds initially. The check [`LevelSpec.truncation()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation\") compares a spec with the occupation lower bound of an operator. It cannot flag the case above. Each term of the beamsplitter generator holds a single creation operator, so the bound is one and the check reports no shortfall at a cutoff of 1, although the result there is wrong:\n"
msgstr "Penaakulan yang sama terpakai pada setiap mod secara berasingan, jadi gabungan had berbeza bagi setiap mod (lihat [Huraikan pemangkasan dengan LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)) menjadikan putaran mudah dipetakan secara salah. Mod yang boleh menerima boson memerlukan had yang meliputi apa yang boleh diterimanya, bukan sahaja apa yang dipegangnya pada mulanya. Semakan [`LevelSpec.truncation()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation\") membandingkan spesifikasi dengan batas bawah penghunian sesuatu pengendali. Ia tidak dapat menandakan kes di atas. Setiap sebutan penjana pemecah alur memegang satu pengendali penciptaan, jadi batasnya ialah satu dan semakan tidak melaporkan kekurangan pada had 1, walaupun hasilnya salah di situ:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A further caution follows from the way the transpiler builds a rotation (next section). It applies the rotation as a sequence of two-mode factors, and the plugin documentation warns that a single factor can populate a level that the complete rotation never reaches. The truncated sequence and the truncated single evolution are then different approximations of the same unitary. A search over 1,080 random three-mode rotations, with one boson in each of two input modes and no double occupation in the output, did not turn up such a case, so treat this as a precaution and not as a common failure. Converge the cutoff as you would for any other circuit, by increasing it until the result stops changing.\n"
msgstr "Satu langkah berjaga-jaga lanjut timbul daripada cara Transpiler membina putaran (bahagian seterusnya). Ia menerapkan putaran sebagai jujukan faktor dua-mod, dan dokumentasi pemalam memberi amaran bahawa satu faktor boleh mengisi aras yang tidak pernah dicapai oleh putaran lengkap. Jujukan terpangkas dan evolusi tunggal terpangkas kemudiannya ialah penghampiran berbeza bagi uniter yang sama. Carian ke atas 1,080 putaran tiga-mod rawak, dengan satu boson dalam setiap dua mod input dan tiada penghunian berganda dalam output, tidak menemui kes sebegitu, jadi anggaplah ini sebagai langkah berjaga-jaga dan bukan kegagalan lazim. Penumpukan had seperti anda lakukan untuk mana-mana litar lain, dengan meningkatkannya sehingga hasilnya berhenti berubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "How the transpiler synthesizes a rotation {#how-the-transpiler-synthesizes-a-rotation}"
msgstr "Bagaimana Transpiler mensintesis putaran {#how-the-transpiler-synthesizes-a-rotation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `optimization` stage of the preset pipeline breaks a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") down in bosonic space first, with the [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") pass and the [`BosonicClementsDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-synthesis-bosonic-clements-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition\") method (registered as `ModeRotation.Clements`). That is a choice of the preset and not a requirement of the framework: a later section lowers the same gate without any decomposition. The decomposition does not exponentiate the full generator in one step. It first factorizes the unitary into at most $M(M-1)/2$ rotations between *adjacent* modes plus $M$ single-mode phases, following the rectangular mesh of Clements et al. <span id=\"id1\" />[\\[1\\]](#id2). Each factor becomes an atomic [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate, which the boson-to-qubit stage maps like any other.\n"
msgstr "Peringkat `optimization` bagi saluran paip pratetap memecahkan [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") dalam ruang boson dahulu, dengan pas [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") dan kaedah [`BosonicClementsDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-synthesis-bosonic-clements-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition\") (didaftarkan sebagai `ModeRotation.Clements`). Itu ialah pilihan pratetap dan bukan keperluan rangka kerja: bahagian kemudian menurunkan Gate yang sama tanpa sebarang penguraian. Penguraian tidak mengeksponenkan penjana penuh dalam satu langkah. Ia mula-mula memfaktorkan uniter kepada paling banyak $M(M-1)/2$ putaran antara mod *bersebelahan* ditambah $M$ fasa mod tunggal, mengikut jaringan segi empat tepat Clements et al. <span id=\"id1\" />[\\[1\\]](#id2). Setiap faktor menjadi Gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") atom, yang dipetakan oleh peringkat boson-ke-qubit seperti yang lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The factorization itself is [`givens_decomposition()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/linalg-givens-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition \"qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition\"), which the decomposition calls. The map from a unitary to the many-body rotation is a group homomorphism, so the product of the factor rotations exactly equals the full rotation on the untruncated space. The mesh therefore adds no error of its own. Its benefit is locality. Each emitted evolution involves only the Pauli terms of the two modes it mixes (or of one mode for a phase), instead of terms across all modes.\n"
msgstr "Pemfaktoran itu sendiri ialah [`givens_decomposition()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/linalg-givens-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition \"qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition\"), yang dipanggil oleh penguraian tersebut. Pemetaan daripada unitari kepada putaran banyak-jasad ialah homomorfisme kumpulan, jadi hasil darab putaran faktor tepat sama dengan putaran penuh pada ruang yang tidak dipangkas. Oleh itu, mesh tidak menambah sebarang ralat sendiri. Kelebihannya ialah kelokalan. Setiap evolusi yang dihasilkan hanya melibatkan sebutan Pauli bagi dua mod yang dicampurkannya (atau satu mod untuk fasa), bukannya sebutan merentasi semua mod.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile a random three-mode rotation and inspect what the pipeline emitted. A generic $3 \\times 3$ unitary needs the maximum of three rotations, plus three phases, and every factor is its own [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate). All of them are declared on the whole register, but the operators inside act on a few qubits only:\n"
msgstr "Transpile putaran tiga mod rawak dan periksa apa yang dihasilkan oleh saluran paip. Unitari $3 \\times 3$ generik memerlukan maksimum tiga putaran, serta tiga fasa, dan setiap faktor ialah [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) tersendiri. Kesemuanya diisytiharkan pada seluruh register, tetapi pengendali di dalamnya hanya bertindak pada beberapa qubit:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With three levels per mode, every mode occupies three qubits. A beamsplitter between two modes touches the six qubits of those modes, and a phase touches the qubits of one mode.\n"
msgstr "Dengan tiga aras bagi setiap mod, setiap mod menduduki tiga qubit. Pembahagi alur antara dua mod menyentuh enam qubit bagi mod-mod tersebut, dan fasa menyentuh qubit bagi satu mod.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The factors are exact only once each evolution is synthesized well. The terms of a beamsplitter generator do not commute, so the default single-step product formula leaves an error in every factor. Pass a product formula with more repetitions to the [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") plugin that maps the factors to reduce it:\n"
msgstr "Faktor-faktor ini tepat hanya apabila setiap evolusi disintesis dengan baik. Sebutan penjana pembahagi alur tidak berkomut, jadi formula hasil darab satu langkah lalai meninggalkan ralat dalam setiap faktor. Hantar formula hasil darab dengan lebih banyak pengulangan kepada pemalam [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") yang memetakan faktor-faktor tersebut untuk mengurangkannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A single boson entering mode 0 leaves in mode $j$ with probability $|U_{j0}|^2$. Compare the synthesized circuit with that exact result for increasing repetition counts. Decompose the circuit first so that the product formula is applied; without it, an exact simulator such as [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) applies the gate as its full exponential and hides the error.\n"
msgstr "Satu boson yang memasuki mod 0 keluar pada mod $j$ dengan kebarangkalian $|U_{j0}|^2$. Bandingkan litar yang disintesis dengan keputusan tepat itu bagi bilangan pengulangan yang meningkat. Uraikan litar terlebih dahulu supaya formula hasil darab diaplikasikan; tanpa itu, simulator tepat seperti [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) mengaplikasikan gate sebagai eksponen penuhnya dan menyembunyikan ralat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The error falls by a factor of about four for every fourfold increase in repetitions, as expected for a first-order formula. The cost grows in proportion, because every factor is repeated.\n"
msgstr "Ralat menurun dengan faktor kira-kira empat bagi setiap peningkatan empat kali ganda dalam pengulangan, seperti yang dijangkakan bagi formula tertib pertama. Kos meningkat secara berkadar, kerana setiap faktor diulang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"mode-rotation-direct-explanation\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lower a rotation without decomposing it {#lower-a-rotation-without-decomposing-it}"
msgstr "Merendahkan putaran tanpa menguraikannya {#lower-a-rotation-without-decomposing-it}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A decomposition in bosonic space is one way to lower a rotation. (The library does not include another way, but the boson-to-qubit stage does not depend on it.) [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") looks a plugin up by the name of the gate, and a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") that was left whole reaches it like any other gate. A plugin for it maps the generator of [`ModeRotation.to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\") in one go and emits a single [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) at unit time. That is all of it:\n"
msgstr "Penguraian dalam ruang bosonik ialah satu cara untuk merendahkan putaran. (Pustaka ini tidak menyertakan cara lain, tetapi peringkat boson-ke-qubit tidak bergantung padanya.) [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") mencari pemalam mengikut nama gate, dan [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") yang dibiarkan utuh sampai kepadanya seperti gate lain. Pemalam untuknya memetakan penjana [`ModeRotation.to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\") sekali gus dan menghasilkan satu [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) pada masa unit. Itu sahaja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register it for the name of the gate in a pass manager that does not decompose it:\n"
msgstr "Daftarkannya untuk nama gate dalam pengurus laluan (pass manager) yang tidak menguraikannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The rotation is now one evolution over all nine qubits, where the mesh has six, of which none spans more than six. The two are not the same approximation. The truncation is applied once to the generator of the whole rotation here, and to every factor separately in the mesh (hence the warning on the cutoff above). The direct path equals [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") of the operator at any cutoff, so it is the reference to compare a mesh against. What it costs is locality: its terms span all modes, and a product formula has more of them to subdivide.\n"
msgstr "Putaran kini merupakan satu evolusi ke atas kesemua sembilan qubit, manakala mesh mempunyai enam, dan tiada satu pun yang merentangi lebih daripada enam. Kedua-duanya bukan penghampiran yang sama. Pemangkasan diaplikasikan sekali pada penjana bagi keseluruhan putaran di sini, dan pada setiap faktor secara berasingan dalam mesh (maka amaran mengenai had di atas). Laluan terus sama dengan [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") bagi pengendali pada sebarang had, jadi ia merupakan rujukan untuk membandingkan mesh. Kosnya ialah kelokalan: sebutannya merentangi semua mod, dan formula hasil darab mempunyai lebih banyak sebutan untuk dibahagikan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Neither is better in general, which is the reason to keep the choice open. Write a plugin like this one to compare lowerings, to use an encoding-specific rotation, or to hand the gate to something that understands it natively.\n"
msgstr "Tiada satu pun yang lebih baik secara umum, dan itulah sebab untuk membiarkan pilihan terbuka. Tulis pemalam seperti ini untuk membandingkan penurunan, menggunakan putaran khusus pengekodan, atau menyerahkan gate kepada sesuatu yang memahaminya secara asli.\n"

